OL,3,AKing Harald V's coffin arrives at Royal
OL,4,APalace, as mourners line Oslo's streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Harald V's coffin is being moved
OL,7,Ffrom Norway's national hospital to the
OL,8,FRoyal Palace in Oslo
OL,10,FAn estimated 10,000 people have lined
OL,11,Fthe streets to honour the late king,
OL,12,FNorway's public broadcaster says
OL,14,FHarald, who was on the throne for 35
OL,15,Fyears, died early on Friday at age 89
OL,17,FKing Haakon VIII has now taken the
OL,18,Fthrone following the death of his
OL,19,Ffather. He has opted to keep the
OL,20,Ffamily's long-standing royal motto:
OL,21,F"All for Norway"
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
